    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d607">

                <pb facs="0935" n="815" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg815"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/871: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-12-23T11:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                                1922—11 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>295. Your 494, December 14:4 P.M.</p>
                <p>Your recommendations concerning the method for making indemnity payments are
                    approved. It is assumed that you intend the retained portion shall be paid into
                    the International Banking Corporation for transmission to the Treasury and that
                    the remitted <pb facs="0936" n="816" xml:id="pg816"/> portion shall continue to
                    be paid by the Inspector General to the Foreign Office in accordance with the
                    Legation’s despatch No. 1838 of December 31, 1917.<anchor n="88"
                        xml:id="d607-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
